data: {"id": "24bd55dbd9da4daf-thinking-parallel_evidence-1261", "run_id": "24bd55dbd9da4daf", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 生命周期确认**\n   - Prometheus 指标 `kube_pod_status_phase` 返回 `Pending=1`，`Running/Failed/Succeeded/Unknown=0`；UID `49f4b3a0-c450-44f9-8baf-ce88e4ed74c4`；单容器 `app`；无重启（`kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` 未返回正值）。\n   - kubectl_describe 确认：`node: <none>`，`status: Pending`，容器 `app` 镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，Command 为 `time.sleep(86400)`。\n\n2. **调度拒绝的直接原因（核心证据）**\n   - Events 显示重复的 `FailedScheduling`，原文均为：**`0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memor", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789110964843, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "24bd55dbd9da4daf-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "24bd55dbd9da4daf", "seq": 1262, "ts_ms": 1789110972842, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 30.549, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v02", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/24bd55dbd9da4daf-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "bc2dcfdb5126f58d005550f34bd482b636418d94d84ab4c96f76fe4dd680687b", "bytes": 2569}, "snapshot_sha256": "286637d9865546ea95bfee013c923905146186b960e94d35663e3e0bfaac179a"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

