data: {"id": "24bd55dbd9da4daf-final", "run_id": "24bd55dbd9da4daf", "seq": 1266, "ts_ms": 1789110982021, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v02/workload` | Pending | Pod workload in aiops-case-v02 namespace is stuck in Pending state. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedScheduling 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found for incoming pod.` (fact-9d293c187066) | 调度器直接报告集群所有 3 个节点均因内存不足且无抢占受害者而拒绝调度。 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | 容器 `app` 请求/限制配置：`memory=1Pi`, `cpu_request=5m`, `cpu_limit=50m` (fact-18015d479d2f, fact-804380571432) | 定义资源约束；1Pi（1 Petabyte）的内存配置远超常规节点规格，是导致“Insufficient memory”的直接原因。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod `workload` 处于 `Pending` 状态 (fact-b1de43bbccde) | 确认 Pod 未能通过调度阶段，未进入运行态。 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` (phase=Pending) 值为 1, sample_count=1 (fact-787e6fea77bb) | 确认 Pod 当前持续处于 Pending 阶段，无 Running 样本。 |\n\n**证据分析**：\n调度事件（#1）明确指出所有节点内存不足。K8s 配置（#2）证实 Pod 请求了 1Pi 内存。在单节点物理硬件无法提供 1Pi 内存的情况下，调度失败是必然结果。状态（#3）和监控（#4）确认了故障的持续性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\nPod 配置 memory 设置为 1Pi (1 Petabyte) → 调度器尝试寻找满足该资源的节点 → 集群节点内存无法满足，且无更高优先级 Pod 可抢占 (No preemption victims) → Pod 停留在 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认根因：**Pod 资源请求配置存在严重错误**。\nPod `workload` 将内存请求和限制（`resource_request.memory` 和 `resource_limit.memory`）均设置为 `1Pi`。这一数值远超集群中任何单节点的物理内存容量，导致 `default-scheduler` 在所有 3 个节点上均判定资源不足（`Insufficient memory`）并拒绝调度。\n\n**证据支撑**：\n- 调度事件明确指出“3 Insufficient memory”及无抢占受害者 (#1)。\n- K8s 配置证实了 `1Pi` 的内存请求值 (#2)。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 52.2s\n├─ 问题定位: 12.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 30.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v02/workload: 30.5s (Evidence 22.6s, RCA 7.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v02/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 52.199, "metrics": {"run_id": "24bd55dbd9da4daf", "mttr": {"value": "52.2s", "seconds": 52.20611000061035, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 52206.11000061035, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 48997.071743011475, "tool_calls": 9, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 9, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 7251.467704772949, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2910.4204177856445}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 12467.443943023682, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 30549.399852752686, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 9168.214321136475, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

